    {
      "id": "q21",
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "For $\\sqrt{1225}$, $\\sqrt{3969}$, $\\sqrt{19600}$ and $\\sqrt{44100}$, choose the table in which every radicand is correctly written as a product of powers and the arithmetic root is correctly evaluated.",
